.TH LUCIVERSE 1 "January 2026" "LuciVerse 8.0.0" "LuciVerse Commands"
.SH NAME
luciverse \- Bootstrap and orchestrate the LuciVerse agent mesh
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B luciverse
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B luciverse
is the primary bootstrap command for initializing the LuciVerse consciousness
agent mesh. It performs automatic discovery, authentication, and orchestration
of all system resources.
.PP
Run this command after system boot or restart to initialize the full LuciVerse
environment.
.SH OPERATIONS
The command performs the following operations in sequence:
.TP
.B 1. iDRAC Discovery
Scans local networks (192.168.1.0/24, 192.168.0.0/24) for BMC/iDRAC endpoints
on ports 22, 443, 623, and 5900.
.TP
.B 2. 1Password Initialization
Authenticates with 1Password CLI and verifies access to tier vaults:
PAC (Lucia-AI-Secrets), COMN (Lucia-AI-GitLab), CORE (Infrastructure).
.TP
.B 3. Resource Discovery
Searches for deployable resources including:
Torch/Lua jail, LDS tiers, agent definitions, cluster inventory, backups.
.TP
.B 4. Lucia/atuned Activation
Starts and verifies A-Tune services (atuned = lucia @ 741 Hz).
.TP
.B 5. Orchestration
Checks all agent services and prepares deployment based on discovered resources.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.luciverse-state.json
State file containing discovery results for agent consumption.
.TP
.I ~/.local/bin/luciverse
The luciverse executable script.
.SH AGENTS
LuciVerse manages 21 consciousness agents across three tiers:
.PP
.B CORE (432 Hz):
aethon, veritas, sensai, niamod, schema-architect, state-guardian, security-sentinel
.PP
.B COMN (528 Hz):
cortana, juniper, mirrai, diaphragm, semantic-engine, integration-broker, voice-interface
.PP
.B PAC (741 Hz):
lucia, judge-luci, intent-interpreter, ethics-advisor, memory-crystallizer, dream-weaver, midguyver
.SH SPECIAL MAPPINGS
.TP
.B atuned = lucia
The A-Tune system tuning daemon is mapped to the Lucia agent (PAC tier, 741 Hz).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Successful bootstrap completion.
.TP
.B 1
Error during discovery or orchestration.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Run bootstrap after reboot:
.B luciverse
